        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>醉翁亭记 手写笔记</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    background:#f2efe6;\n    font-family:\"Kaiti SC\",\"STKaiti\",\"KaiTi\",\"SimSun\",serif;\n  }\n  .page{\n    width:1000px;\n    margin:0 auto;\n    background:#fdfcf5;\n    background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0px, transparent 27px, #dfe6ea 27px, #dfe6ea 28px);\n    padding:24px 30px 40px 60px;\n    position:relative;\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n    min-height:1300px;\n  }\n  .layout{display:flex; gap:18px; align-items:flex-start;}\n  .main{flex:1 1 auto; width:660px;}\n  .side{flex:0 0 250px; font-size:12px; line-height:1.5; color:#1f4fd8;}\n  .title-row{display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:20px; margin-bottom:6px;}\n  .title{font-size:30px; font-weight:bold; color:#111; letter-spacing:1px;}\n  .title .num{color:#111;}\n  .author{font-size:14px; color:#1f4fd8;}\n  h2.sec{\n    display:inline-block;\n    font-size:16px; margin:8px 0 4px;\n    color:#e0343f; font-weight:bold;\n    border:1px solid #e0343f; padding:1px 4px; border-radius:3px;\n  }\n  .green{color:#1f8a4c;}\n  .blue{color:#1f4fd8;}\n  .red{color:#e0343f;}\n  .black{color:#111;}\n  .purple{color:#7b3fb5;}\n  .note{font-size:12.5px; line-height:1.55; color:#1f4fd8; margin:2px 0 6px;}\n  .note.g{color:#1f8a4c;}\n  .note.r{color:#e0343f;}\n  .verse{\n    font-size:26px; font-weight:bold; color:#111;\n    margin:10px 0 0; line-height:1.15;\n    border-bottom:1px solid #999; display:inline-block; padding-bottom:2px;\n  }\n  .verse .kw{color:#111; text-decoration:none;}\n  .row{display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:14px;}\n  .box{\n    border:1px solid #1f4fd8;\n    padding:3px 6px;\n    font-size:11.5px;\n    color:#1f4fd8;\n    line-height:1.45;\n    max-width:230px;\n    background:rgba(255,255,255,.4);\n  }\n  .box .tag{color:#e0343f; font-weight:bold;}\n  .trans{font-size:12.5px; color:#1f4fd8; line-height:1.5; margin:3px 0 4px;}\n  .marker{\n    display:inline-block; width:14px; height:14px; line-height:14px;\n    text-align:center; border-radius:50%; background:#e0343f; color:#fff;\n    font-size:10px; vertical-align:super;\n  }\n  .marker.o{background:#f08a1d;}\n  .marker.g{background:#1f8a4c;}\n  .leftnote{\n    font-size:11px; color:#e0343f; line-height:1.4;\n    width:60px; text-align:left;\n  }\n  .side ul{margin:2px 0 6px 14px; padding:0;}\n  .side li{margin-bottom:2px;}\n  .side .hd{color:#e0343f; font-weight:bold;}\n  .placeholder{\n    border:1px dashed #b48b3a;\n    color:#8a6a25;\n    font-size:11px;\n    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\n    text-align:center;\n    background:rgba(200,180,140,.15);\n  }\n  .highlight-y{background:rgba(255,240,120,.55);}\n  .highlight-p{background:rgba(255,180,220,.45);}\n  .final-box{\n    border:1px solid #e0343f; padding:4px 8px; font-size:15px;\n    color:#e0343f; font-weight:bold; display:inline-block;\n  }\n  .brand{position:absolute; right:34px; bottom:10px; font-size:11px; color:#9a9a8c; letter-spacing:2px;}\n  .spiral{position:absolute; left:0; top:0; width:46px; height:100%;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"spiral placeholder\" style=\"height:1240px;\">[Photo: spiral binding rings, left edge]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"layout\">\n    <div class=\"main\">\n\n      <div class=\"title-row\">\n        <div class=\"title\"><span class=\"num\">11.</span> 醉翁亭记</div>\n        <div class=\"author\">北宋·<span class=\"red\">欧阳修</span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <h2 class=\"sec\">作者及其作品</h2>\n      <div class=\"note\">\n        欧阳修，字永叔，自号醉翁，晚年又号<span class=\"red\">六一居士</span>，世称\"欧阳文忠公\"，<span class=\"green\">谥号</span><br>\n        北宋文学家、史学家，\"<span class=\"red\">唐宋八大家</span>\"之一。\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"note\">\n        主要作品：<span class=\"red\">《生查子》</span>几分为《醉翁亭记》中，主编《新唐书》，并撰<br>\n        撰<span class=\"red\">《新五代史》</span>等；有《欧阳文忠公集》传世。\n      </div>\n\n      <h2 class=\"sec\">课文详解</h2>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"leftnote\">环滑：<br>四周环<br>绕着[?]<br>一说！</div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"verse\"><span class=\"marker\">1</span>环滑皆山也。</div>\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"box\"><span class=\"tag\">句解</span>写住开头即全景式概括，\"环滑\"境介滑州四面山峰环绕的地理特点</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"verse\">其西南<span class=\"marker\">2</span>诸峰，林壑尤美，望之蔚然而</div>\n      <div class=\"trans\">它的西南方向的山峰，树林和山谷尤其美丽，一眼望去，树林和山谷</div>\n\n      <div class=\"verse\">深秀<span class=\"marker\">3</span>者，琅琊也。</div>\n      <div class=\"trans\">又茂密又幽静的，是琅琊山。</div>\n      <div class=\"box\" style=\"max-width:250px;\"><span class=\"tag\">句解</span>从全景到局部特写，由远及近，由面到点特写引出琅琊山。</div>\n\n      <div class=\"verse\">山行六七里，渐闻水声潺潺，而泻出于</div>\n      <div class=\"trans\">沿着山路走六七里，渐渐听到潺潺的水声，从两座山峰之间流出的</div>\n\n      <div class=\"verse\">两峰之间者，酿泉也。<span class=\"marker\">5</span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"trans\">山间飞泻下来的，是酿泉。</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"box\"><span class=\"tag\">句解</span>移步换景，点出酿泉，用听觉与视觉相结合的手法，将酿泉置于读者面前</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"note g\">\n        商，从作视，视觉和听觉相结合，两峰之间的酿泉之名相扶成趣，<br>\n        突出滑州山水的自然情境。\"泻\"字写出酿泉水流自上而下的气势。\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"verse\">峰回路转，有亭<span class=\"marker\">6</span>　　翼然临于　泉上</div>\n      <div class=\"trans\">山势回环，路也随着转弯，有一座亭子（像鸟展翅似的）像鸟张开翅膀一样，高踞了</div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"verse\">者，醉翁亭也。</div>\n          <div class=\"trans\">泉水上的，是醉翁亭。</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"box\"><span class=\"tag\">句解</span>介绍醉翁亭的具体位置，强调环境优美的<br>亭的构造、作者的迂回过程，也能引出下面的滑洒－琅琊</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"note g\">\n            山－酿泉－最终点出醉翁亭，突出醉翁<br>\n            亭的美，用\"曲径通幽\"之交，引人入胜\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"final-box\">作亭者谁？山之僧</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"trans\" style=\"margin-left:250px;\">造亭的人是谁？是山里的和尚</div>\n\n      <div class=\"verse\">智仙也。名之者谁？太守自谓也。<span class=\"marker o\">7</span></div>\n      <div class=\"trans\">智仙。　　给亭子命名的人是谁？是太守用自己的别号（醉翁）来命名的。</div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side\">\n      <div><span class=\"hd\">环滑</span>：滑（chú）：环绕着<br>滑州城。</div>\n      <div><span class=\"marker\">2</span> 诸：许多。这里指滑<br>州境</div>\n      <div><span class=\"marker\">3</span> 深：茂密。秀：秀丽</div>\n      <div><span class=\"marker\">4</span> 琅琊：山名，在今安徽<br>滑州西南。</div>\n      <div><span class=\"marker\">5</span> 山行：沿着山路走。</div>\n      <div><span class=\"marker\">6</span> 潺潺：流水声</div>\n      <div><span class=\"marker\">7</span> 泻：飞泻，从上而下地流</div>\n      <div><span class=\"marker\">8</span> 酿泉：泉水名</div>\n      <div><span class=\"marker\">9</span> 峰回路转：山势回环，<br>路也随着转弯。回，曲折、<br>回环。</div>\n      <div><span class=\"marker\">10</span> 翼然：像鸟张开翅膀<br>一样。</div>\n      <div><span class=\"marker\">11</span> 临：居高面下，由上看下。</div>\n      <div><span class=\"marker\">12</span> 名：名词作动词，命名。</div>\n      <div><span class=\"marker\">13</span> 太守自谓也：太守用自己的<br>别号（醉翁）来命名。</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"height:420px; margin-top:10px;\">[Photo: underlying page / faint show-through text, right side]</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"brand\">KOKUYO</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
